# A core that sets its version 1 context negotiation interface in its
# first retro_run, after its load has returned and its device was made:
# the harness refuses the call and fails the run. Refused, the core logs
# no error of its own.
# error: SET_HW_RENDER_CONTEXT_NEGOTIATION_INTERFACE after its core's load is refused
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate late
10 end
